# CALL Bibliography for Postgraduate Study.

**Authors:** Levy, Mike, Green, Alison

## Abstract
Cites significant publications in the field of computer-aided language learning (CALL), citing 133 general works, 41 on methodology and instructional design, 35 on multimedia, 12 on interface design, 27 on word processing and writing, 25 on concordancing, 18 on intelligent CALL, and 37 on computers in general education and the humanities. A list of CALL journals is included. (MDM)

**Source:** https://eric.ed.gov/?id=EJ506798

